# Files left out of the Docker build context (the repo root), for the client and API images.
# Smaller context = faster builds, and no secrets or local build output in an image.

# Dependencies and build output: images install and build their own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
server/src/generated

# Secrets: environment files never go into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Git, local tools, and test output
.git
.claude
**/coverage
qa-evidence
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
.playwright
.playwright-cli
**/*.log
